  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-7646" textLabel="3-oxoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] reductase, chloroplastic" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-7646" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="130" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>cDNA clones encoding the fatty-acid- biosynthetic enzyme |FRAME: CPLX-7646 3-oxoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] reductase, chloroplastic| were isolated from an Arabidopsis thaliana leaf library. The N-terminal end of the coding region shows features typical of a stromal-targeting plastid-transit peptide |CITS: [1575676]|. The deduced amino acid sequences have 41% and 55% identity respectively with the nodG-gene product of Rhizobium meliloti, one of the host-specific genes that restrict infectivity of this bacterium to a small range of host plants.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-7646" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="3-oxoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] reductase" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="3-ketoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] reductase" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="&amp;beta;-ketoacyl-[acyl-carrier-protein] reductase" />
      <Property key="Synonym_4" value="3-oxoacyl-[acp] reductase" />
      <Property key="Synonym_5" value="&amp;beta;-ketoacyl-[acp] reductase" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT1G24360-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-15237, RXN-15236, RXN-15235, RXN-15234, RXN-15233, RXN-15232, RXN-15231, RXN-4562, RXN-15230" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="9" />
